Qt / PySide6 (LGPL-3.0)
-----------------------
The bundled GUI toolkit (Qt, via PySide6) is used under the terms of the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 (LGPL-3.0). The Qt libraries are
separate files in the application folder (_internal/PySide6/Qt/lib), not
